OL,5,G2100 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical music.
OL,8,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,9,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,10,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,11,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,12,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,13,     Feverything in between.
OL,14,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,15,     FSoweto presents highlights from
OL,16,     Fthis year's Jazzahead in Bremen,
OL,17,     FGermany. Tonight, we hear from
OL,18,     Ftrombonist Nabou Claerhout and a
OL,19,     Flive track from her set.
